     {
      "label_value": "Second reading moved",
      "value": "<p><a href=\"http://tex.parliament.vic.gov.au/bin/texhtmlt?form=VicHansard.dumpall&db=hansard91&dodraft=0&house=ASSEMBLY&speech=73284&activity=Second+Reading&title=CRIMINAL+PROCEDURE+BILL&date1=4&date2=December&date3=2008&query=true%0a%09and+%28+activity+contains+'Second+Reading'+%29%0a%09and+%28+hdate.hdate_3+=+2008+%29%0a%09and+%28+hdate.hdate_2+contains+'December'+%29%0a%09and+%28+hdate.hdate_1+=+4+%29%0a%09and+%28+house+contains+'ASSEMBLY'+%29%0a\">Click Here to View the Second Reading Speech</a></p><p>Under the Government Business Program agreed to by the House 03/02/2009, debate on this bill must be completed by 4.00 pm on Thursday 05/02/2009. Debate resumed 03/02/2009; the Opposition (Mr Clark) on behalf of the Coalition circulated amendments.  Debate continued 04/02/2009.</p>",
      "format": "rich_text",
      "processed": "<p><a href=\"http://tex.parliament.vic.gov.au/bin/texhtmlt?form=VicHansard.dumpall&amp;db=hansard91&amp;dodraft=0&amp;house=ASSEMBLY&amp;speech=73284&amp;activity=Second+Reading&amp;title=CRIMINAL+PROCEDURE+BILL&amp;date1=4&amp;date2=December&amp;date3=2008&amp;query=true%0a%09and+%28+activity+contains+'Second+Reading'+%29%0a%09and+%28+hdate.hdate_3+=+2008+%29%0a%09and+%28+hdate.hdate_2+contains+'December'+%29%0a%09and+%28+hdate.hdate_1+=+4+%29%0a%09and+%28+house+contains+'ASSEMBLY'+%29%0a\">Click Here to View the Second Reading Speech</a></p><p>Under the Government Business Program agreed to by the House 03/02/2009, debate on this bill must be completed by 4.00 pm on Thursday 05/02/2009. Debate resumed 03/02/2009; the Opposition (Mr Clark) on behalf of the Coalition circulated amendments.  Debate continued 04/02/2009.</p>",
